=== empirical TypeDB syntax probes against the real live instance (informed the adapter design) ===
probe: reference to an undefined type -> HTTP 400 code INF2 (confirms the check-before-mutate error signature used elsewhere in this codebase)
probe: define an already-defined identical schema -> HTTP 200, no error (TypeDB's define is idempotent on this instance; initialize() needs no check-before-mutate probe)
probe: insert a duplicate @key attribute value on a second entity -> HTTP 400 code CNT9 (confirms updates must delete-then-insert, motivating ingest()'s overwrite behavior)

